00:10:19,190 --> 00:10:19,490
Okay.

135
00:10:19,760 --> 00:10:22,700
Logically, we start with Thomas Edison.

136
00:10:23,950 --> 00:10:28,300
And what is the tense of this passive sentence?

137
00:10:28,960 --> 00:10:33,550
We look at be and we see that it's were

