And the last sentence. Revisions are being made by the team.

167
00:12:34,250 --> 00:12:41,960
Now we start with the team because the team did something or is doing something.

168
00:12:42,590 --> 00:12:44,570
So the team.

169
00:12:45,480 --> 00:12:47,960
And then we again inspect this.

170
00:12:47,970 --> 00:12:49,290
What do we see here?

171
00:12:49,290 --> 00:12:51,090
What is this formation?

172
00:12:51,090 --> 00:12:53,790
What does it what does it look like?

173
00:12:53,790 --> 00:12:55,770
Are being are being?

174
