What tense form is it?

175
00:12:58,920 --> 00:12:59,920
-ing

176
00:12:59,970 --> 00:13:04,110
And be be plus verb with -ing.

177
00:13:04,140 --> 00:13:06,630
Yes, it's continuous form.

